From 2fac1f39a83b325229816856fbccaa8ae5fac324 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:11:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ci): repair five corrupted workflow files that failed at
 parse time

ci.yml, build.yml, main.yml, codeql.yml and config.yml contained pasted
"[cite: N]" tokens and duplicated `uses:`/`run:` keys from conflicting
Dependabot merges, making them invalid YAML so every run failed instantly.

- strip stray "[cite: N]" tokens
- de-duplicate `uses:` steps, keeping the newer Dependabot-bumped version
- rewrite main.yml: remove duplicated steps, fix escaped \${{ secrets.* }}
  expressions, add missing vercel-project-id, pair upload/download-artifact v7
- all 35 workflow files now parse with no duplicate keys

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WtxWSYZrHMCVoKhm9cyQhV
